<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables - Seagate Technology.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables - Seagate Technology.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Wednesday Seagate Technology Inc was not available for after-hours trading for news.</p>
<p>The exchange said Mellon Bank Corp's preferred J stock, Corimon SACA, Westmoreland Coal Co and Westmoreland preferred A stock were also not available.</p>
<p>Seagate said earlier in the day that it reached tentative settlements on two separate securities class action suits. It also reported diluted per share earnings of $0.84 for the second quarter against $0.63 for the same period last year.</p>
</text>
